	RainIntensifying: The thorn rain is growing more intense...
	StormApproaching: A thorn storm is approaching!
	MiniTornadoSpawned: A mysterious vortex has emerged in the ocean depths...
	StormOfFourStarted: The Storm of Four has awakened! Four ancestral tornadoes have emerged across the world!
	TornadoDefeated: The {0} Thorn Tornado has been silenced! ({1}/4)
